<title>UK: SEK sets 500 mln Swedish crown five-year bond.</title>
<headline>SEK sets 500 mln Swedish crown five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Svenska Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT (SEK)</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SKR   COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    13.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.885   PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
